.git/
bin/
# Local Go build cache (/cache in .gitignore). Untracked and unbounded -- 29GB on the
# machine this was found on, which the daemon transferred as build context on EVERY
# interop image build: >10 minutes, blowing test/interop/run.py's own 600s build timeout
# and saturating the host. Nothing in any Dockerfile reads it. Now that
# .github/workflows/evidence-nightly.yml runs ze-interop-test, a context this size would
# also make the nightly job a permanent red.
cache/
docs/
plan/
rfc/
etc/
.claude/
gokrazy/
ai/
test/
!test/scripts/ze_api.py
!test/perf/configs/
!test/ipsec-interop/ze-linux
*.md
